   "id": 504209,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How does this <a href=\"http://openstax.org/l/28vectorscalar\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">video</a> help you understand the difference between distance and displacement? Describe the differences between vectors and scalars using physical quantities as examples.\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 991481,
     "content_html": "It explains that distance is a vector and direction is important, whereas displacement is a scalar and it has no direction attached to it."
    },
    {
     "id": 991482,
     "content_html": "It explains that distance is a scalar and direction is important, whereas displacement is a vector and it has no direction attached to it."
    },
    {
     "id": 991483,
     "content_html": "It explains that distance is a scalar and it has no direction attached to it, whereas displacement is a vector and direction is important."
    },
    {
     "id": 991484,
     "content_html": "It explains that both distance and displacement are scalar and no directions are attached to them."
    }
   ],
